'''Mossgreen Village''' (Japanese: '''マツモタウン''' ''Matsumo Town'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Kanto]]. It is a small town found between the {{safari|Kanto}} and [[Cinnabar Island]]. It was featured in ''[[EP044|The Problem with Paras]]''.

Mossgreen Village is home to a medicine shop, which is owned by [[Cassandra]] and her grandmother {{OBP|Lacy|EP044}}. They make their own potions to sell to traveling {{pkmn|Trainer}}s, which is how they ended up meeting {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}}. The shop has its very own {{p|Parasect}}, which helps them make the medicines and potions they need. There is also a {{p|Persian}} that helps guard the shop.

